; the LAYOUT-COMPOSITE family (installFlowObjs: EmbeddedTextFlowObj,
; IncludedContainerAreaFlowObj, SideBySideFlowObj, SideBySideItemFlowObj,
; AlignedColumnFlowObj — the five Universitat-Politecnica classes of
; style/{EmbeddedText,IncludedContainerArea,SideBySide,SideBySideItem,
; AlignedColumn}.cxx). All five are plain CompoundFlowObjs with NO ports:
; each is one start*/end* bracket around its content. `side-by-side` and
; `aligned-column` carry a bare DisplayNIC, `side-by-side-item` carries
; nothing at all, `embedded-text` one symbol, and `included-container-area`
; a NIC that DERIVES from both DisplayNIC and InlineNIC and adds nine fields
; of its own. The styled range's upper bound is FOC_ALIGNED_COLUMN until the
; online block below.
define FOC_EMBEDDED_TEXT: int 49
define FOC_INCLUDED_CONTAINER_AREA: int 50
define FOC_SIDE_BY_SIDE: int 51
define FOC_SIDE_BY_SIDE_ITEM: int 52
